window.products.push({"id":567066,"name":"Butterfly Gifts for Women, Butterfly Blanket Fleece Soft Cozy Throw Blanket for Couch Bed Living Room, Lightweight Flannel Plush Warm Travel Throws an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BEPZH3j5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM FABRIC CONSTRUCTION: This flannel fleece throw blanket utilizes 100% premium microfiber polyester that is super soft, fluffy, anti-pilling, durable, and lightweight. COZY SNUGGLES IN OUR PERFECT WEIGHT BLANKET: With a generous size of 50 x 60 inches, ​our throw-size bed blanket can be used by both adults and children alike. Its smooth feel and plush weight make it the ideal choice to wrap yourself up when relaxing, lounging, or reading. YOUR PETS WILL LOVE IT TOO: throws for the sofa are perfect as a living room decor and as a puppy, cat and dog blanket for pets of all sizes. And make your home even more comfortable for evenings with family and friends. EASY CARE: Machine wash with cold water on gentle and delicate. Tumble dry on low heat. Avoid direct heat and no bleach. Wash alone to prevent abrasion. It is wrinkle and fade resistant, never shed. NICE GIFT: Given Its Beautiful Pattern, This Fleece Blanket Can Be A Good Choice As A Gift, Which Conveys The Concern And Blessing To Your Family, Friends And Lover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BEPZH3j5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rivarche","source_asin":"B09J3Q122K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J3Q122K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J3Q122K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567067,"name":"Aladdin Insulated Art Mug, 12-Ounce by Heisuke Kitazawa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HB7TAZf2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Aladdin Artist Series. Like an art gallery. Only smaller. Spend your lunch hour savoring beauty with the new Aladdin Artist Series that puts art in your hands. Aladdin has been creating lifestyle products for people just like you since 1908. From the character lunch boxes you remember as a kid to the sleek mug you use to tote your morning coffee, we’re committed to creating unique food and beverage solutions that fit your lifestyle. Products that are sustainable, stylish, and above all, functional. Products to love. We think art makes the little things in life even better. That’s why we created the first ever Aladdin Artist Series. This initial collection celebrates the brilliant work of emerging artists from around the world. This one? Heisuke Kitazawa of Japan. Enjoy his art. On the way to work. During lunch. After dinner. Wherever, whenever. It’s art the way it oughta be. About the Art Work By: Heisuke Kitazawa Amy Ruppel’s illustrations have adorned snowboards, paperweights and wellies. Those are rain boots. It’s a good thing, too. She’ll need those boots in her hometown of Portland, Oregon. Her work has been shown widely in the Pacific Northwest and in galleries across the United States. THE ALADDIN ARTIST SERIES. Gallery-worthy art made mobile. Shoppers today might not seek out a rare Picasso, but a hand-held work of art is the perfect everyday luxury. That’s why we created the Aladdin Artist Series, featuring the original work of six emerging artists. Enjoy their art at home. On the go. Whenever, wherever. It’s art, the way it oughta be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HB7TAZf2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aladdin","source_asin":"B004OUOHFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004OUOHFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004OUOHFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
