window.products.push({"id":567154,"name":"Mokosha Natural Honey Comb Hand Rolled Beeswax Taper Candles Eco-Friendly Smoke and Soot Free Tea Candle Gift Box for a Romantic Dinner or Special Occ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9126eUclNUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mokosha 100% Beeswax Taper Candles Beeswax is a natural wax produced by honey bees. The tapers burn longer and brighter than paraffin. Due to the greater cost of wax candles, often candles are not made entirely of beeswax, but are added to other materials to extend the burning time and imitate natural aroma. Pure Beeswax Candles are made of 100% natural wax and burn with almost no smoke or soot. All candles are hand rolled. Neutralizing Pollutants: 100% pure Beeswax candles release negative ions when burned that helps to neutralize pollutants in the air. Hypo-allergenic, benefits those with allergies, sensitivities, and asthma Relaxation: The simple act of burning a candle has relaxing properties and can aid in stress relief and meditation. It is also used in aroma therapy Lower Toxicity: Beeswax candles are all natural, they do not produce toxic by-products and heavy soot when burned Long Burn Time: The melting point of beeswax is higher than paraffin and soy wax, making beeswax last longer than others. These tea light candles require a larger wick to burn efficiently Fragrance : Smell great as they are naturally scented by the honey and floral nectar in the honeycomb. Specifications: Burn Time Each (10\"\") Candle (black): ~4 hours. Burn Time Each (10\"\") Candle (black): ~4 hours. Candle Size: 10\"\"x7/8\"\", 25cmx2.2cm Candle Size: 10\"\"x7/8\"\", 25cmx2.2cm Candle Weight: 1.41oz, 40g Candle Weight: 1.41oz, 40g Package is made of Recycled Paper and Wood, Includes: 2 pcs set 2 pcs set 100% Satisfaction Guarantee: Click, “Add to Cart” and Buy with Confidence","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9126eUclNUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mokosha","source_asin":"B07ZL2N78S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZL2N78S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZL2N78S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
