window.products.push({"id":567216,"name":"Zmirne Portable Fan for Travel, 20000mAh Rechargeable Battery Powered Fan, Run Up to 58H, High-Velocity Camping Fan with LED Light, Hanging Hook, Pers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nmrrsvdIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"20000mAh Super Battery Capacity - Are you still worried about running out of power and not being cool enough when you are out camping? This 20,000mAh rechargeable battery-powered fan will last up to 72 hours on natural air (1 speed) with no endurance anxiety! Built-in 5V/3A type-C input/output port and 5V/2A USB output port, you can quickly charge the portable fan or use it as a power bank to power other devices, which is a good helper for camping trips, power outages, hurricanes, etc. High Velocity & Quiet Fan - This camping fan is designed with a unique double-layer 3-blade fan, this advanced tech helps the turbine drive more air faster for most purposes even at the lowest speed, not to mention it has 4 speeds. The balanced fan blades ensure a noise level as low as 30 dB. The USB personal fan provides you with cool air circulation while ensuring you have a quiet experience without being disturbed. Clear Lighting Even Outdoors - This portable camping fan for outdoor travel can even be used as a camping light has 16 LED beads with 3 brightness levels, the brightest setting can help you focus on your work in the dark/at night, the second setting can illuminate a camper or a small space, and the 1st setting can be used as night lighting while you sleep. Do A Good Job of Every Detail for You - The fan and light are controlled by separate buttons. 4 LED indicators show the fan speed, and the other 4 LED indicators show the remaining power, and the most proud of us is the SLEEP MODE Button, it will help you turn off all the lights if you don't want any light when you are sleeping. Portable Battery Fan - This camping fan for travel has a foldable hook so you can hang it inside a tent, on a tree branch or in a car, etc. to let it blow a breeze from the top; it has a sturdy base so you can also stand it as a table/desk fan indoor and the fan head can rotate 270 degrees to circulate air from the desired angle. Sturdy & Durable - In order to let you better enjoy the freedom of outdoor travel, the outdoor tent fan designed for you strives to pursue the military-grade drop-proof level, after a 1-2m drop test the fan can still run normally and work stably in the violent bumps, ensuring that it is more convenient and free to carry and use outdoors. About Charging - 5V/3A USB C cable is included, the adapter is not included. Due to the large capacity of the fan battery, please use a 5V/3A power adapter if you need to charge quickly (8-9 hours full).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nmrrsvdIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zmirne","source_asin":"B0C5XFBP5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5XFBP5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5XFBP5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567217,"name":"Primitives by Kathy Chalk Art Pillow, 10-Inch Square, Decorative Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ftQgg3JYL._AC_.jpg","description":"CAREFULLY BUY ONLY FROM AMAZON or trusted Amazon partners to guarantee authentic pillows with premium quality printing, stitching, and fabrics. Spot clean only with a damp cloth. In 1997, Kathy made her first \"primitive candle box\" by hand, taking care into each detail from the sanded edges to the type of ribbon tied on the wire handles, each was a work of passion. As Primitives by Kathy grows, the company works to give back, starting with an initial relationship with Goodwill Services and expanding into several more charitable causes held both by the company and those the company supports on behalf of their employees. They are constantly inspired by the people, places and things around us. Kathy travels the world to pull inspiration first hand from cultures around the globe. Look for all of Primitives by Kathy for inspirational, fun, sarcastic, and heart-warming gifts and home decor. You'll want to have one for yourself and another for someone you care about.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ftQgg3JYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primitives by Kathy","source_asin":"B01BNPSRP0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BNPSRP0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BNPSRP0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
