window.products.push({"id":567226,"name":"1/2 oz. Measured Liquor & Wine Pourers - 1 Dozen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a5jO73KSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1 dozen Clear Top 1/2 oz. Posi-Pour portion pour spouts. These are used by wineries & wine clubs for wine tastings. They are also used in bars for pouring 'double-shots' to provide 1 ounce of liquor while giving customers the impression they are getting 2 shots per drink. The 1/2 oz. portion provides 50+ shots per 750ml wine bottle and 67+ shots per liter liquor bottle. Note: The standard cork will be too small for the opening on a half-gallon or 1.75L bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a5jO73KSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magnuson","source_asin":"B07Q24QLZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567226","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q24QLZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q24QLZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567227,"name":"Atlas Vintage Farmhouse Outdoor and Indoor Wall Mount Original Oil Lamps Lantern with Size of 13” Height. Lampara de Aceite. (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SEypNunoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Atlas oil gas lantern lamp has been designed perfectly in terms of both appearance and use. Shows an impressive stance at 13 inches. Can be hung on the wall with the iron bracket Burns up to 24 hours on 13.5 ounce of fuel, it is more effective than candles in terms of both lighting and visual. It is easy to clean, you should wash it gently by hand and you can let it dry. The wick should not get wet. An oil lamp is an object used to produce light continuously for a period of time using an oil-based fuel source. The use of oil lamps began thousands of years ago and continues to this day, although their use is less common in modern times. They work in the same way as a candle but with fuel that is liquid at room temperature, so that a container for the oil is required. A textile wick drops down into the oil, and is lit at the end, burning the oil as it is drawn up the wick. Oil lamps are a form of lighting, and were used as an alternative to candles before the use of electric lights. Starting in 1780, the Argand lamp quickly replaced other oil lamps still in their basic ancient form. These in turn were replaced by the kerosene lamp in about 1850. In small towns and rural areas, the latter continued in use well into the 20th century, until such areas were finally electrified and light bulbs could be used. Sources of fuel for oil lamps include a wide variety of plants such as nuts (walnuts, almonds, and kukui) and seeds (sesame, olive, castor, or flax). Also widely used were animal fats (butter, ghee, fish oil, shark liver, whale blubber, or seal). Camphine, a blend of turpentine and ethanol, was the first \"burning fluid\" fuel for lamps after whale oil supplies were depleted. It was replaced by kerosene after the US Congress enacted excise taxes on alcohol to pay for the American Civil War. Oil lamps of today are primarily used for the particular ambience they produce","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SEypNunoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09GW6L69B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GW6L69B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GW6L69B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
