window.products.push({"id":567235,"name":"Dried Lavender Wildflower Bridal Bouquet, Freshly harvested Real Natural Lavender Bunch Royal Velvet Lavender Bundles for DIY Home Office Party Weddin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RDq9znaJL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Small Dried bouquet with pink larkspur and ammobium that is great for for crafting bouquets, and decorations for weddings and home furnishing. over 14 in. long stems -small: 3.4-4.5\" wide (approximate) 150 stems 100% certified organic, farm direct flowers * 2022 harvest EXTRA LARGE is seen in the photos above. WHAT YOU NEED TO KNOW: *Price includes priority shipping *Please note that bouquets arrive in condensed condition up to 2-3” smaller than stated measurements. We do this to ensure safe travel and minimal petal loss. It is up to our buyer to fan them out upon arrival. Items will need to be fanned out for display and to reach full circumference. The final product may vary slightly from the pictures shown, due to the handmade process and natural materials used. The aroma of each bundle will last for 7-8 months. Make sure to store outside of direct sunlight for the longest life. * We do our best to keep colors as accurate as possible, colors may slightly differ due to monitor, season and harvest. Colors of flowers may vary due to the nature of monitors, dried flowers and seasons. PLEASE contact us if you have any questions about current flowers. * All of our lavender is grown 100% certified organic and harvested by our family from our lavender farm in Carmel Valley California. We do not apply any pesticides or chemical fertilizers to our crops. To learn more about our sustainable growing practices please visit our website Nustadfamilyranch.com Shipping Information: All bundles are carefully wrapped in paper and padded to minimize bud loss during shipping. We ship via USPS. Due to the nature of dried flowers, some petal loss is inevitable. We do our best to minimize petal loss by carefully packaging the flowers and always purchase insurance on our parcels. PLEAS NOTE* items ship free ONLY ship: USPS FIRST CLASS, PRIORITY, GROUND. We","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RDq9znaJL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nustad Family Ranch","source_asin":"B07RY5RWHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567235","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RY5RWHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RY5RWHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
