window.products.push({"id":567270,"name":"CZUMJJ 4 oz Circular Glass Food Storage Containers Set of 24, Small Containers with Locking Lids, Airtight Glass Food Jars for Food Portion, Snacks | ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812x7PdDv1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"24 PACK GLASS CONTAINERS - You can get 24 pack 4 oz circular containers with various colorful lids. The glass food containers are perfect for portion control, leftover foods storage, salad dressings, taking the snacks on the go or for other individual servings. Perfect addition to the kitchen! MICROWAVE/FREEZER/DISHWASHER SAFE - Made of thick and durable high borosilicate glass with polypropylene lids, these small meal prep containers will not leach chemicals into the foods. You can put them in the freezer and fridge. It would be a great choice for reheating food in the microwave or oven (without the lids). The glass containers with lids won’t get scratched or stained. They are easy to clean and dishwasher safe (on the top rack). AIRTIGHT SEAL - The high quality snap style lids with silicone gasket and four latches make them fit tightly, airtight, no spills or leakage.It can keep food fresh for longer. The snap-on tops are colorful so that you can designate them to your usage. Prep the meal ahead for workdays could save your time in cooking. QUALITY ADDITION TO THE KITCHEN - These stackable food storage containers are designed to save more space when not in use. Highly recommend for cooks in the kitchen that want a quality storage container! With such a good quantity of containers,small portion or leftovers can be well separated for better holding or storage. It is a good option in the lunch box and intimate gift for family or friends. CUSTOMER CARE - Our 24 pack cute glass containers with snap-on lids are packaged well. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you receive a broken product or are not satisfied with the products. We will provide with the best solution, such as refund, or resend within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812x7PdDv1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CZUMJJ","source_asin":"B0B9BVXBP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BVXBP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BVXBP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
