window.products.push({"id":567340,"name":"The Rusty Roof-Distressed Lucy Black-Solid Wood Picture Frame-12x18","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DwImlN0-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Featured is the Distressed Lucy Black Picture Frame, which is a hand made wood picture frame hand-painted and hand-distressed, made right here in the USA!.  Frame Moulding Width: Approx 1.5 inches. Frames up to 20x24 include glass, backing, and hangers. Frames larger than 20x24 include acrylic rather than glass, for safety. These frames are available in a wide variety of colors and sizes, and this frame is perfect for weddings and traditional decor.  We can make any size that you need, including the most common sizes, such as 4x6, 5x7, 8x10, 12x12, 11x14, and 16x20. Contact us with any questions or requests for a special size that we do not have listed.  You can choose the size you need, or change the color in the dropdown menu above.  Frame size is determined by the size artwork the frame will hold. For example, if your artwork is 8x10, choose an 8x10 frame. Our frames are sized by the inner dimension, not the outside measurement.  The visible area of the artwork will be 1/2 inch smaller than the size of the frame. For example, the visible area of an 8x10 frame is 7.5x9.5, due to the lip of the frame that holds in the glass and artwork.  Please note: various screens display colors differently, and actual color may vary slightly from what is pictured.  Please contact us with any questions, we look forward to doing business with you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DwImlN0-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Rusty Roof","source_asin":"B07WS2RQCS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WS2RQCS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WS2RQCS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567341,"name":"Christmas Stocking Hangers for Mantel, Luke Decor Christmas Stocking Holders for Mantle Set 4 Stocking Hooks for Mantle Stocking Holder Fireplace","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pdCRvYddL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Christmas stocking holders for mantle, your stockings won’t be the only focal point—the colorful mantle stocking hangers will definitely pop against your mantel. Let our fireplace stocking hangers spread the holiday cheer for you! Colorful Christmas Stocking Hangers for Mantel: The stocking holders for mantle set 4 contain 4 Christmas patterns. The iconic stocking hook enlivens any mantel with classic holiday figures and colors. With an Exquisite Hand-polished and Colorful Design, the stocking holder will charm its way onto your mantel! No Assembly Required, Non-Slip Stocking Hooks for Mantle: Non-Slip rubber grip pads on the underside of the top piece protect your mantel from being scratched. Safe Stocking Holder for Mantle: If your fireplace is > 2 inches, or you want to fix the hook, you can use the non-damage double-sided tape to stick the Christmas stocking hooks to your fireplace, the kids and pets can pull on the stocking hangers for mantel set of 4 and they won't get hurt by falling hooks. High-Quality Stocking Hooks for Fireplace: The stocking mantle holders are made of metal, not easy to bend or break, and the mantel stocking holder has power-plated making it anti-rust. The mantle stocking holders can be used for a long time. Wide Uses: You can use the stocking mantle hangers to hang Christmas ornaments and holiday decorations. After the holidays, you can repurpose the Christmas stockings holders to hang car keys, jewelry, or scarves. Specifications: Color: colorful Material: metal and plated Size: 4'' x 4'' Weight to bear: 15 lbs What you will get: 1 x s flake stocking holders for mantle 1 x Christmas tree mantle hooks for stockings 1 x reindeer stocking holders for mantle 1 x s man stocking holder 1 x double-sided tape Please note: Due to manual measurement, the size of the stockings holder may have a certain error.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pdCRvYddL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luke Decor","source_asin":"B0B5WZH15Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WZH15Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WZH15Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
