window.products.push({"id":567352,"name":"Hickory Manor House Vintage Blanc Corolla Swan for Home Decor, 22-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810htytr9KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For over 30 years, Hickory Manor House/Craft-tex has produced unique home accessories. Swans have long occupied the pages of legendary stories and folklore. Now you can bring the elegance and timeless mystique of the swan into your garden with the Carolina Swan. Handcrafted from wood this authentic-looking decorative decoy features a vintage blanc finish that enhances its traditional antique style. This swan will make a delightful addition to your flower garden. The detailed process of crafting this swan and others like it in the American Waterfowl Collection involves detailed carving molding and finishing. First master carvers hand-carve the original American Waterfowl sculpture. Next molds are made from the originals and then hand-cast using a variety of mediums to ensure the exact detailing of the original woodcarving. Then American folk artists from North Carolina paint them by hand to specifications using acrylic paint and stain. The artist signs and dates each piece. Finally a protective coating is applied to ensure long-lasting resilience to the outdoor elements. The result of this detailed process is a realistic-looking swan decoy proudly made in the Craft-Tex/Ladybug Craft-Tex and Ladybug are special product lines produced by Concept Plastics Inc. Concept Plastics is Americas premier maker of fine furniture and decorative resin castings. Established in 1970 in High Point N.C. Concept Plastics uses extremely accurate molding techniques exceptional craftsmanship in casting and artisan skills in hand finishing. The Craft-Tex and Ladybug lines offer a wide variety of products for the home office and garden including birdbaths fountains statues planters bookends and decorative wall decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810htytr9KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hickory Manor House","source_asin":"B00NWH5D7S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567352","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00NWH5D7S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00NWH5D7S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567353,"name":"Catalonia Yellow Fleece Throw Blanket for Couch, Super Soft Fuzzy Plush Blanket for Adults and Kids, All Seasons Lounging Velvet Blanket, Living Room ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VgEJM6S5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super Soft Throws ultra-smooth fleece material, single layer, durable, and elegant match any decor. Travel, work from home, college dorm, college gift. Cozy and warm throw blanket: perfect for family members or friends who use to get cold while they are sitting, reading, or watching TV. Standard 50x60 plush blanket for adults and kids, feel snuggle when curling up on the couch on a cold day or chilly night. Made of high-quality micro fabric for soft touch. Care Instructions: Dry clean, separately machine wash in cold wate Makes a great gift, Great for holidays gift, Mother Day's Gift, Thanksgiving gift, Christmas gift,Birthday gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VgEJM6S5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Catalonia","source_asin":"B09W4QLR6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567353","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W4QLR6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W4QLR6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567354,"name":"J4U Window Film Privacy Frosted 3D Marble Texture Decorative Glass Sticker Static Window Cling for Home Bathroom/Office 23.6\"x78.74\"(60x200cm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619BZ1FwUiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Window Privacy Film Use Steps: Step 01. Keep Window or Glass cleanStep 02. Wet the Window or Glass with water(Soapy water will be the best choice)Step 03. Remove from backing protect film(which is a kind of clear vinyl, please MAKE SURE remove it before you apply the window film to glass)Step 04. Apply to wet glass and smooth with handsStep 05. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Seller Tips: 1. The static cling effect of the film may not be good if the glass is not clean. Solution: Before application, use the towel to make it clean2. Fit for a smooth surface without any dust or fiber.3. Do not apply to windows with cracks.4. More efficient in teamwork, a product of energy-saving and environmentally friendly.5. Affix tape on both sides to remove the window film from the backing film. *Only Applies on Smooth Glass Surfaces* Key Notice For Frosted Window Decor:1. If you want to remove it, simply peel the window film from any corner. It comes off cleanly without leaving residue2. When not in use, the film must be replaced and stored on the original backing film. The side of the film that touched the glass should face the glossy side of the backing film3. Our film does not apply to carved, over a frosted or irregular glass Frosted Window Film Q&A: Q: How long will this film last?A: In normal condition, it will last for more than 8 years on the windowQ:Why there is bubbles inside?A:Because the water is not cleaned out entirly. After you position the film, please smooth out the film with squeegee, make the air bubbles and water out completelyQ:Could this film be used for more than one times?A:Yes, but the stickup side of the film must be completely clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619BZ1FwUiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J4U","source_asin":"B099YVFLNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099YVFLNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099YVFLNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567355,"name":"Freshware 6-Cavity Silicone Robot and Key Chocolate, Candy and Gummy Mold, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Rt1ZL0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create your own special sweets or homemade soaps with the Freshware CB-606BR 6-Cavity Silicone Robot and Key Chocolate, Candy and Gummy Mold. This mold is constructed with 100% pure, professional quality food-grade silicone, which meets US FDA and European LFGB safety standards (BPA, PVC and Phthalate FREE). Simply pour your favorite recipe in the mold, prepare, and cool completely. Then turn it upside down, this flexible silicone mold offers a non-stick surface that allows the sweets to pop right out with a little push from the bottom. Remember to place the silicone mold on a baking sheet for easier positioning and removal. Mold Size: 9 x 4.1 x 0.6 inch. Cavity Size: 2.6 x 1.8 x 0.6 inch. Volume: 6 x 0.7 oz, Total 4.2 oz. Many customers have found creative ways to use Freshware silicone molds (depending upon the shape) to create delicious chocolates, candies, gummies, butters, caramels, ice cubes, frozen baby foods, gelatin, ice creams etc. Other customers use the molds in unique ways to create clays, resin casting, candles, soaps and more. All Freshware silicone products DO NOT have Chemical Coatings and are Pinch Test Passed. Our silicone mold handles temperature from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius). Reusable for up to 3,000 uses, our molds save money by eliminating the need to ever buy disposable paper liners again. Safe to use in the Oven, Refrigerator, Freezer, Microwave, Steamer and Dishwasher. Top rack dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended to extend the life of the product. What Is A Pinch Test? Cheaper brands often use plastic fillers in their silicone products, so it is not safe for high-temperature baking. Pinch and twist a bit of the silicone, if it turns white, it’s got fillers as 100% pure silicone will retain its color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715Rt1ZL0BL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freshware","source_asin":"B00CBGPI6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CBGPI6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CBGPI6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567356,"name":"LA Linen 60-Inch Wide Natural Burlap , 30 Yard Roll","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h5w2DMn7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Burlap is tough and durable enough for use in the construction and crafts. It can also be used as a weed barrier. Burlap can be used for backing for rugs, wall hangings, upholstery and decorative dollies. This material can be embroidered with fabric scraps, yarn and other remnants to create wall hangings. It can also be employed with the ends sewn up for a rustic window treatment. Stretched over a frame it can be used as an alternative to canvas for painting . Caring for the burlap is tricky since it can shrink, fray on the edges and become very wrinkled. One simple method of cleaning your burlap fabric is to simply shake them and hang them outside. The sunlight might bleach away lighter stains and odors can air out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81h5w2DMn7S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LA Linen","source_asin":"B07QS5BGMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QS5BGMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QS5BGMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
