window.products.push({"id":567480,"name":"TENOVEL 3-Piece Bathroom Shower Sets: 50”-72” Adjustable Curved Shower Curtain Rod, 72”x72” Clear EVA 5G Shower Curtain Liner, Stainless Steel Shower ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IZ1HoxLvS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"3-PIECE SETS INCLUDING : An Adjustable Curved Shower Curtain Rod, a clear 100% EVA Shower Liner and 12pcs Stainless Steel Shower Curtain Hooks. Each package includes curved shower rod, shower hooks and shower liner, mounting brackets, wall anchors, screws and instructions. STAINLESS STEEL ADJUSTABLE CURVED SHOWER CURTAIN ROD: The Steel shower rod is rust and Corrosion-resistant; 50-72” adjustable design fits standard 60 or larger 72-inch tubs but fits 50 inch spaces as small as 50 inches; Curved design provides up to 9 inches of extra elbow room and shower space. This new version of shower rod can be installed normally without using the tube plug. The manual is the old version, please ignore the part about the tube plug in the installation instructions. DURABLE RESISTANT EVA SHOWER CURTAIN LINER: Made of high quality durable EVA material; 72”*72”clear shower liner is easy to clean and waterproof; 3pcs encased magnets at bottom to keep the liner in place and reduce billowing; 12pcs rust proof copper grommets for easy to hang the shower curtain hooks; Wipe clean with a damp cloth; For best results, open fully after each use to air dry. STAINLESS STEEL SHOWER HOOKS :Made of rust proof Non-magnetic stainless steel with polished chromed for durability;Smooth rolling ball bearings eliminate snagging, tugging and pulling of the curtain;Fit securely and rolls nicely on 3/4\" to 1-1/8\" diameter shower rods to prevent the shower curtain from falling off. Designed and manufactured by TENOVEL.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31IZ1HoxLvS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TENOVEL","source_asin":"B07H1Q1TGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H1Q1TGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H1Q1TGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567481,"name":"Department56 6002313 Harry Potter Village Ollivanders Wand Shop Lit Building, 7.88\", Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8128yl8F9xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Located in Diagon Alley, Ollivanders was founded in 382, BC. It is the place where every young wizard receives his or her wand. Do you choose the wand, or does the wand choose you? Special details include the iconic curved glass bay windows. Known for bringing realistic and architecturally accurate buildings to the world, Department 56 has spared no expense in working with Warner Brothers Studios to bring you a series of iconic Harry Potter buildings and accessories that look amazing and truly captivate all ages. These highly detailed, lighted buildings are crafted using the exact specifications from the movie studio to create an unbelievably lifelike experience for the Harry Potter fan. From the majesty of Hogwarts Castle, to Hagrid’s Hut, Ollivanders Wand Shop, and a good game of Quiddich, Department 56 has truly brought the movie to life. About Department 56: Over thirty years ago, Department 56 began as part of Bachman's, a premiere retail florist in Minneapolis. Bachman's used a numbering system to identify each of its departments. The number assigned to wholesale gift imports division was, you guessed it, 56. Now headquartered in Eden Prairie, Minnesota, Department 56 has become a leader in the giftware, collectibles and holiday decorating industry and is best known for our hand-crafted lighted villages, Snowbabies figurines and extensive lines of holiday and home decorative products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8128yl8F9xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B0B8YCL381","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8YCL381","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8YCL381","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
