window.products.push({"id":567498,"name":"VSUDO 2 Rolls 35.4\" by 78.7\" Privacy Window Film, Frosted Stripe Pattern Window Tint, Static Cling Window Glass Sticker for Home (38.75 Sq. Ft Total)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71psIoLNvBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Can we protecting our privacy and keeping the room still bright by natural sunlight? The answer is YES. Our decorative privacy window film can help you to make it happen. Highlight Features: -Protecting privacy and keep home or office bright -Decorate home to be more fashionable -No glue/no adhensive design, static clings to the glass firmly, far away harmful chemicals -Blocking 95% of UV ray away and filtering strong sunlight, prevent furniture from aging and fading -Reusable, ideal for rental places. No residue left on the glass, you can reposition it and reuse Where to use? -The static cling decor window film applies to any smooth glass surface, it can be trimmed or combined to fit any size window. -You can use our window films on windows of living room, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, and use on front door window, sliding glass door window, glass cabinet panels. This window film fits for office, house, restaurant, bar, shop and home etc. Installation Steps: 1. Cut films to required size, about 1 inch larger than the window 2. Clean the glass surface 3. Use the spray bottle, wet the glass with soapy water or clear water 4. Peel off the back protective film 5. Stick films on glass 6. Use the squeegee to remove the water and air bubbles 7. Trim the margin and cut off the excess edges Package Include: 2 Rolls Window Film: 35.4 inch By 78.7 inch (90 X 200CM) Tips: 1. This product is only suitable for smooth, flat and clean glass surface.Do not use on rough, uneven, frosted glass or other materials. 2. Please make sure to peel off the backing film before applying and apply the smooth side of film to glass. Otherwise it will not be firmly adhered. 3. This window film can show the colors perfectly just when the light is going through or reflected, so usually you can’t see the colors of window film before installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71psIoLNvBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VSUDO","source_asin":"B082DJZKFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082DJZKFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082DJZKFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567499,"name":"PINK RHINO LABS Swedish Dishcloths for Kitchen 10 Pack – Reusable Swedish Dish Towels: Replace Cellulose Sponges for Kitchen Cleaning, Dish Towels for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71veBKy31QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sustainable Cellulose / Natural Renewable Cotton Better for You, Better for Earth – Zero waste products: Our kitchen cloth uses biodegradable, compostable 70% cellulose, 30% cotton (original Swedish dish cloth) and cornstarch packaging. An eco friendly, all natural cellulose sponge cloth that is dishwasher and washing machine safe can last for months; 1 Swedish dish clothes replaces 5 sponges or 15-17 paper towel rolls. Dries faster than absorbent kitchen towels & contains no plastic unlike microfiber cleaning cloth for glasses and other uses. Tough, Super Absorbent Towels – Soaking up 20X its weight Swedish Dish Cloths are more absorbent than 100% cotton cloth, dishrags, kitchen cleaning towels, kitchen rag, reusable kitchen wipes, reusable cleaning wipes, chamois and many super absorbent kitchen towels. Washable up to 50 times; 140°F/60°C top rack of a dishwasher or toss into a washing machine. Air drying is recommended to avoid shrinking. Great for wiping up spills/messes in any household but especially for families with children. Odor Resistant, Quick Dry – Many reusable cleaning cloths, reusable paper towels washable roll, papaya reusable paper towels or reusable bambooper towels reusable/washable do not dry quick enough and in turn harbor bacteria and germs (stinky dishcloth, washcloth, washrag). Versatile Smooth & Patterned Sides – Other Swedish cloth or reusable kitchen towels may provide no scrubbing power. Our Swedish sponge cloth is smooth on one side with diamond pattern (better than striped) on the other. Great for all kinds of cleaning: washing & drying dishes, countertops, appliances, bathroom (mirror, sink, tub, shower), office, windows, glasses streak free, granite, marble, stainless steel (oven hoods, fridge), tile, wood (furniture), plastic, interior car detailing, etc. The Pink Rhino Labs Approach – We have tested sizes, materials, patterns and packaging until we found the most workable combination for you! Our premium kitchen cleaning cloths come from Europe unlike many cheap, thinner, less effective options. This cellulose dish cloth works like magic, a sponge cloth crossed with reusable towels! Our European dish cloth is more than a paper towel replacement cloth or reusable towel for kitchen. We stand behind this quality with a 100% Satisfaction Guarantee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71veBKy31QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PINK RHINO LABS","source_asin":"B08XB8R8HG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XB8R8HG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XB8R8HG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
