window.products.push({"id":567615,"name":"hawos BILLY 200 Grain Mill Stone Flour Mill 220-240 Volts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714NIws6rIL._AC_SL1371_.jpg","description":"hawos Billy grain mill is encased in high-density plywood, an outstanding material that guarantees a long-life product and offers progressive yet elegant styling. The milling chamber is made out of hygienic, food light plastic (not made of plywood!). The grain direction of each 11 layer of wood of the plywood housing is turned 90°. The plywood used is composed of thin cross-laminated layers of wood bonded under extremely high pressure. This results in an exceptionally high degree of stability, which cannot be achieved in non-bonded wood. Using the time proven millstones, the BILLY 200 produces very fine flour from a wide variety of grains, for all the regular grains like wheat, rye, spelt and is very good for other items like chick peas, lentils and corn. The motor is a brushless direct drive, providing good output and reliable operation for decades. The corundum milling stones are infinitely adjustable and self-sharpening, designed for long life and continued fine flour output. Grains: Wheat, Rye, Spelt, Maize, Durum Wheat, Rice, Chickpeas, Dried Peas, Quinoa, Amaranth. Technical Specifications : • Housing Birch ply • Grinding capacity for (wheat) -fine approx. 220 g/min -course approx. 400-500 g/min • Hopper capacity (wheat) approx. 1500 g • Grindstone ø (corundum ceramic stones) 100 mm • Weight approx. 10.6 kg • Motor output mains Voltage 600 W 220-240 V • High allowance for bowls 17 cm • Footprint Dimensions (W x D x H) 210 x 210 x 450 mm • Surface-finish Linseed oil varnish If you need gluten-free mill, please tell us directly after place your order Made in Germany We ship Worldwide!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714NIws6rIL._AC_SL1371_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Happy Mills","source_asin":"B01IS5JA7C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IS5JA7C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IS5JA7C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
