window.products.push({"id":567831,"name":"Bestier 5 Tier Industrial Bookshelf for Bedroom, Tall Bookcases and Book Shelves 5 Shelf for Living Room, Free Standing, Gray and Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":132.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O+MMC9rSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"📚Multipurpose Bookshelf- Open storage shelves design provides ample spaces for displaying your decorations. Like family photos, novels, speakers or plants and many other items. You can easily match with other furniture and decor. 📕Dimensions- The overall dimensions of the bookshelf are 23.6\" L x 11.7\" W x 63.8\" H. A distance of 11.7 inch between each shelf. 📘Sturdy Industrial Bookcase- Heavy metal frame with X-frame backing on each side ensures the stability of this bookshelf. Each shelf can hold up to 50lbs. 📗P2 Class Board- Made of high quality and environment-friendly P2 grade particleboard, which meet the US CARB (California Air Resources Board) standards. Not only provides great stability and durability, but also offers you a safe and healthy environment in your home office bedroom. 🛠️Easy Assembly & Free Service- Our bookshelf comes with a simple and clear assembly instruction to make installation a breeze. We provide lifetime professional customer service and always strive for 100% customer satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O+MMC9rSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bestier","source_asin":"B09LRSKZRD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LRSKZRD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LRSKZRD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567832,"name":"Synra S-Shaped Metal Hooks, Space Saver, Organize Pots, Pans, and Utensils, Ideal for Bird Feeders and Chimes, Stainless Steel, 10 Pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gWYVJN0rL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"Hang Parrot Accessories Without A Hassle --- While buying parrot accessories, each parrot owner faces the problem of hanging them. What if that ladder falls when their birdie is trying to move up and down? Synra provides you with the solution with our S-shaped hooks that are strong and sturdy. Whether it's a wooden chewer or step ladder, hang them vertically or horizontally without worry using the black S-shaped bird accessories. Tired of Hanging The Feeders Again and Again --- Discard the cheap plastic hooks which make your bird feeders fall off the ground time and again. Our S-shaped black metal hooks provide stability and durability to the bird’s treat dispensers. Synra’ stainless steel S-hooks are ideal for hanging bird feeders and wind chimes. Create a feeding station by positioning dowels at a different height on each side of a post. Then, use our hooks to hang feeders with different seeds. Not Just For Birds and Parrots --- If you are a parent of a small pet, we realize there are several products that need to hang into their enclosures such as water bottles, hammocks, and treat dispensers. With our S-hooks, you can attach these and more such products into their line so that they can access them easily. Reclaim Valuable Space --- The value-pack of 10 S-hooks by Synra is perfect for utilizing lost space. Hang them on your baker’s rack, add a towel rack under a cabinet and use our hooks for coffee mugs, measuring cups, or utensils. Organize your purses, scarves, and necklaces with Synra hooks. Hang our hooks in your closet to get your purses off the floor and to quickly see and organize your accessories. Never forget what you have and save the drawer and floor space!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gWYVJN0rL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Synra","source_asin":"B085BH641V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085BH641V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085BH641V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
