window.products.push({"id":567905,"name":"GMISUN 2 oz Small Clear Glass Bottles, 12 Pack Shot Bottles with Caps, Ginger Shots Bottles, Mini Liquor Bottles with Lids for Liquid, Ginger, Juice, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7181olVTkqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【EASY TO CARRY & PRESERVE FRESH】: These 2oz small glass bottles with caps are made of heavy-duty and thick food-grade clear glass to ensure durability and liquor freshness, enabling you to better signify the liquid and make no mistake in picking up the right bottle. The airtight caps make sure liquids inside the shot bottle will stay fresh. Each bottle is light even filled with liquids. 【ZERO LEAKAGE 2OZ MINI LIQUOR BOTTLES】: Compare to other 2 oz wellness shot bottles, GMISUN offers extra 12pcs heat shrink capsules which can be easily heated by a simple hair dryer within minutes to seal the top, access was designed for ripping it off. The special design caps can fit tightly on the small bottle top and have a plastic stopper that helps secure without leakage. 【MULTI USES】: The 2oz glass shot bottles with caps can be filled with juice, ginger, whiskey, potion, alcohol, liquor, hot sauce, and maple syrup. It is perfect for kitchen, party favors, and whiskey sample bottles, you can place these small bottles in your tote bag, purse, cosmetic bag, backpack, etc, extremely convenient to share with your friends. 【DISHWASHER SAFE】: These ginger shots bottles are lead-free and dishwasher safe, you can let the dishwasher clean the 2oz bottles for you, which is very convenient. Please note, putting the caps and the shrink capsules in the dishwasher is not recommended, as this may cause them to fail to use properly. 【CAREFUL PACKAGE AND RISK-FREE】: GMISUN puts a soft foam on both the top and the bottom of the box, and cardboard between each ginger shots bottles with caps to prevent them from scratching and getting shatter. If there is any damage to the product you receive, please feel free to contact us at any time, we will give you a satisfying solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7181olVTkqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GM GMISUN","source_asin":"B0BMW1Z6M5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMW1Z6M5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMW1Z6M5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
