window.products.push({"id":567918,"name":"Sherline (LM5) 5th Wheel Trailer Hitch Weight Scale","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GBiCS5+3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Sherline made this scale at the request of several of their customers who own fifth-wheel trailers. This scale is a modified version of our original Trailer Tongue Weight Scale. However, it is specifically designed to attach to most fifth-wheel trailer hitches. The piston has also been modified to accept the standard 2-13/16″ diameter kingpin and the locating pin is for hitches that accept the standard 2-13/16″ kingpin. The scale uses a simple hydraulic principle to convert pressure into a reading in pounds on the gauge. No delicate electronics, no batteries, and only one moving part. It comes with a 5000 lb. gauge since 5th-wheel trailers typically carry a larger percentage of the overall weight on the hitch. The scale is machined from solid billet steel and aluminum. It has a 3.25″ piston and body diameter, a 6″ square by 1″ thick aluminum base, and is about 6″ high. Actual weight is 11 lb. Gauge diameter is 2.75″. This scale comes with a one year guarantee.  Please note: When you receive your fifth-wheel trailer hitch weight scale, the “locator pin” will be screwed into the top of the base for ease of shipping and storing. Unscrew the locator pin and screw it into the center hole in the bottom of the base as seen in the photo above.Per the manufacturer - Never lift this product up by the piston, only by the base, or damage may occur.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GBiCS5+3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sherline","source_asin":"B01N3QFR7H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567918","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N3QFR7H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N3QFR7H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":567919,"name":"Cool Mist Humidifiers for Bedroom, 4.8L Quiet Ultrasonic Air Humidifiers for Kids, Baby humidifiers for Room Adjustable Mist Auto Shut Off 12-40H Run ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RFOhmUi9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【QUIET COOL MIST HUMIDIFIER FOR BEDROOM】 Quietly releases cool mist so that the dry air in the room will not be a problem,allowing you to breathe easily and get a more peaceful sleep.It also moisturizes the skin and relieves discomfort caused by dryness.Safe for baby rooms and bedrooms. 【HUMIDIFIER WITH WATER PURIFICATION FILTER】The humidifier has a built-in water filter at the water inlet,which can help remove impurities and dust in the water and release clean mist,so that you have clean fresh air around you,keeping your family breathing smoothly and plants healthy.The water filter can be used for 1 year. 【TOUCH BUTTON OPERATION】The humidifier has four touch buttons for switch,mist adjustment,timer and humidity setting.The filled humidifier can be turned on immediately by simply clicking the switch button.At the same time,it is equipped with a timer of 1-8 hours and a humidity setting of 45-90%.When the air humidity reaches the preset humidity,the humidifier will automatically turn off,providing you with quiet ,comfortable and smart humidification. 【LONG DURATION】The humidifier has 3 fog levels,the high-end can be used for 21 hours,and the low-fog level can be used for up to 40 hours.The 1.27gal large water tank does not need to be refilled many times and can be used on the table or on the ground,which is very suitable for use in bedrooms,living rooms,offices and other places. 【ESSENTIAL OIL HUMIDIFIER】Put your favorite essential oil from the humidifier directly into the water at the water inlet.After turning on the humidifier,the fragrance of the essential oil will be distributed into the room with the cool mist,and you can enjoy freshness and beauty at home air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RFOhmUi9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUDLET","source_asin":"B09MFC5PDF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-567919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MFC5PDF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MFC5PDF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
